        <name>wrapper_name</name>
        <qualifiedname>AVCodec::wrapper_name</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Group name of the codec implementation. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>This is a short symbolic name of the wrapper backing this codec. A wrapper uses some kind of external implementation for the codec, such as an external library, or a codec implementation provided by the OS or the hardware. If this field is NULL, this is a builtin, libavcodec native codec. If non-NULL, this will be the suffix in <ref refid="structAVCodec_1ad3daa3e729850b573c139a83be8938ca" kindref="member">AVCodec.name</ref> in most cases (usually <ref refid="structAVCodec_1ad3daa3e729850b573c139a83be8938ca" kindref="member">AVCodec.name</ref> will be of the form &quot;&lt;codec_name&gt;_&lt;wrapper_name&gt;&quot;). </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
